BT /F1 10 Tf 12 TL 56 760 Td (conversion from free to paid is uncertain. Our current financial thinking assumes modest early) Tj T* (revenue from referrals and a small share of users converting to the premium tier, and we intend) Tj T* (to refine these assumptions with pilot data. Our main costs will be software development, data) Tj T* (licensing for pharmacy prices and basic cloud infrastructure.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Competition) Tj T* () Tj T* (The prescription savings space is crowded. Several well-known discount card and coupon services) Tj T* (already let people look up prices and print or show a card at the pharmacy. Large pharmacy) Tj T* (chains and insurers have their own apps, and some online pharmacies offer low-cost generics by) Tj T* (mail. Most of these services are designed for the general population and earn money by taking a) Tj T* (share of each transaction.) Tj T* () Tj T* (We believe Moneymeds can differentiate itself in three ways. First, we focus on young adults) Tj T* (with chronic conditions rather than all consumers, which lets us tailor the experience and the) Tj T* (education to their situation. Second, we combine price comparison with budgeting, whereas most) Tj T* (competitors stop at the pharmacy counter. Third, we compare across several discount sources) Tj T* (rather than promoting a single one. We acknowledge that larger competitors could add similar) Tj T* (features, and that our advantage will depend on how well we understand and serve this specific) Tj T* (group.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Team) Tj T* () Tj T* (Priya Raman, chief executive officer, is a senior studying public health. She has volunteered) Tj T* (at a campus health center and leads product direction and user research. Daniel Okafor, chief) Tj T* (technology officer, is a computer science senior who built the first version of the app and) Tj T* (manages development and data integration. Maya Lindqvist, chief operating officer, is a junior) Tj T* (in business administration who handles partnerships, outreach and early financial planning. We) Tj T* (have also had informal conversations with a faculty member in health policy and a local) Tj T* (pharmacist, who have offered feedback but are not formally involved.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Milestones and Financials) Tj T* () Tj T* (We have defined our core concept and formed a Delaware C corporation. We have built a working) Tj T* (prototype that compares prices for a limited set of common medications using publicly available) Tj T* (and sample data. We launched the prototype with our first outside users, a small group of) Tj T* (students recruited through campus contacts, and have begun collecting feedback on how they use) Tj T* (it. Early comments suggest users value seeing price differences and want better budgeting) Tj T* (reminders, though our sample is small and we have not yet measured savings or retention. We) Tj T* (have a basic website describing the product.) Tj T* () Tj T* (To date we have spent only a few thousand dollars, funded by the founders, mainly on legal) Tj T* (formation, hosting and data access. We have no revenue. Over the next twelve months we expect) Tj T* (to need roughly seventy-five thousand dollars to expand data coverage, improve the app, run a) Tj T* (larger pilot and begin discussions with discount providers about referral agreements. We have) Tj T* (not yet built a detailed financial model beyond these estimates.) Tj T* () Tj T* (What We Are Asking For) Tj T* () Tj T* (We are applying to this competition for funding, mentorship and connections. Prize money would) Tj T* (go toward licensing more complete pharmacy price data and running a pilot with several hundred) Tj T* (users. We would especially value guidance from mentors with experience in healthcare) Tj T* (regulation, privacy and partnership agreements, since we are still learning how to handle) Tj T* (sensitive health information responsibly. We would also welcome introductions to campus health) Tj T* (centers, clinics and potential discount program partners. Our goal for the coming year is to) Tj T* (show that users save real money and keep using the app, which would give us a stronger basis) Tj T* (for raising outside investment.) Tj ET
